msgstr ""

#: ui/ui.glade:17
msgid ""
"This application is developed and maintained by the ParsLinux team to "
"facilitate AMD and Intel graphics driver and acceleration stack "
"installation. The drivers are sourced from official ParsLinux, Debian, and "
"vendor repositories.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Driver Source and Usage</b>\n"
"While this is an official ParsLinux application, open-source Mesa drivers "
"and proprietary acceleration firmware are developed by the open-source "
"community, AMD, and Intel Corporation.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Disclaimer:</b>\n"
"Please note that while we strive to ensure a smooth installation process, "
"ParsLinux cannot guarantee the performance or compatibility with all "
"hardware configurations. Users install these packages at their own "
"discretion and risk.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Issue Reporting:</b>\n"
"Feel free to report any issues or concerns via our GitHub repository: <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/parslinux/-parslinux-amd-intel-installer\"> "
"ParsLinux GitHub </a>"
msgstr ""

